<%
  /* Six identical cards in a 3x2 grid is one of the most recognizable
     generated-layout patterns there is — the uniformity itself is the
     tell, regardless of how good the copy inside each card is. This is
     now an essay: a lede set large on the left, and the six commitments as
     numbered clauses on the right, the way a register states its terms.

     Every claim below is a policy the store operates. The previous
     version's sixth card ("With over 10,000 satisfied buyers") was an
     unverifiable figure and has been removed rather than restated. */
%>
<section class="why-us">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reg-head">
      <span class="reg-head__num">&sect; 04</span>
      <h2 class="heading-section reg-head__title">What sealed actually means here</h2>
      <span class="reg-head__aside" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--color-text-muted)">The Zyphera standard</span>
    </div>

    <div class="why-essay">
      <div class="why-essay__lede">
        <p>Every product we list is bought through authorized distribution and stays sealed in our hands until it ships to you. No secondary market, no exceptions.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="why-clauses">
        <li class="why-clause">
          <span class="why-clause__n" aria-hidden="true">i.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="why-clause__title">Distributor direct, never secondary</h3>
            <p class="why-clause__desc">We buy from official TCG distributors only. We do not purchase from individuals, collectors, or resale marketplaces, which is what makes an unbroken chain of custody possible in the first place.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-clause">
          <span class="why-clause__n" aria-hidden="true">ii.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="why-clause__title">Packed to survive the courier</h3>
            <p class="why-clause__desc">Boxes ship inside a rigid corrugated outer carton, wrapped to protect corners and shrink-wrap integrity. The seal you receive is the seal it left the distributor with.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-clause">
          <span class="why-clause__n" aria-hidden="true">iii.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="why-clause__title">Same-day dispatch</h3>
            <p class="why-clause__desc">Orders placed before 2PM ship the same business day.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-clause">
          <span class="why-clause__n" aria-hidden="true">iv.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="why-clause__title">Tracked worldwide</h3>
            <p class="why-clause__desc">Fully tracked and insured to every market we serve.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-clause">
          <span class="why-clause__n" aria-hidden="true">v.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="why-clause__title">Secure checkout</h3>
            <p class="why-clause__desc">Payments handled entirely by established processors.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-clause">
          <span class="why-clause__n" aria-hidden="true">vi.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="why-clause__title">Cancel before dispatch</h3>
            <p class="why-clause__desc">Any preorder, full refund, right up until it ships.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
